<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian 1996 sugar beet output rises to 305,500 T.</title>
<headline>Tunisian 1996 sugar beet output rises to 305,500 T.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's sugar beet harvest in 1996 was 305,500 tonnes, up from 270,400 tonnes in 1995, official statistics showed on Monday.</p>
<p>Domestic white sugar production generally averages some 11 percent of the country's consumption. ($=1.104 dinar)</p>
</text>
